      "Once it's a loose paste, pour in the rest of the milk and stir well or shake hard with the lid on until smooth.",
      "Taste and adjust the honey — the powder is nutty but not sweet on its own. Serve cold over ice, or warm the milk first for a cosy winter version.",
      "Give it a stir if it stands a while, as the grains slowly settle."
