    "name": "Béchamel (White Sauce)",
    "emoji": "🥛",
    "cuisine": "French",
    "time": 15,
    "costPP": 7,
    "feel": "The mother of all white sauces — butter, flour and milk cooked into something silky and pourable. Master this one and mac & cheese, lasagne and a dozen others are yours.",
